{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"tanis-dolman","name":"Tanis Dolman","birthDate":"","birthPlace":"","bio":"Tanis Dolman (also credited as Tanis Dolman-Johnson) is a Canadian film and television actress based in Vancouver, British Columbia. With a career spanning over two decades, she is primarily part of the Pacific Northwest's vibrant entertainment industry, known for delivering memorable character and supporting performances across major Hollywood blockbusters, streaming hits, and indie films. Dolman's career features a diverse mix of high-profile studio projects and television guest spots. Her most prominent recent role is in the 2026 Netflix romantic comedy Voicemails for Isabelle.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T18:05:06+00:00","tmdbId":2041208,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/2041208","credits":[{"id":"deadpool-2","title":"Deadpool 2","character":"Neighbor #2"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/tanis-dolman.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Voicemails for Isabelle","year":2026,"character":"Mom","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/canZTWSxACSnAluir3dCtMxKpA1.jpg"},{"name":"Carrie","year":2026,"character":"Ms. Feinglass","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6mUMquPQBFJGqTACS3Azkwwrx8d.jpg"},{"name":"Curious Caterer: Foiled Plans","year":2024,"character":"Agatha Wynford","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/buJJMj1NLVufwPaFu1ApFHQQdxh.jpg"},{"name":"Return to Sender","year":2024,"character":"Giselle","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2lYe79lR80Ty5avD549lsTLuXUo.jpg"},{"name":"Hellmark","year":2023,"character":"Executive","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tSKMFGXEky0VVZrI1Tzl2XalCfE.jpg"},{"name":"Engaged to Be Murdered","year":2023,"character":"Caroline","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/o2yWiKKE4kzIYRQLEiJdg2epzCS.jpg"},{"name":"The Irrational","year":2023,"character":"Dr. Kelley","mediaTyp